# SocietyHub

SocietyHub is a modern residential and rental management platform designed for apartment communities, housing societies, flat owners, renters, and admin teams. It provides a premium SaaS-style dashboard for managing properties, applications, rent collection, maintenance, communications, and resident operations.

This project is designed as a working MVP that can be run locally and deployed to common free-tier hosting services.

## Features

- Premium dashboard for society operations
- Property listings and occupancy tracking
- Application review workflow
- Payment and rent collection overview
- Maintenance request tracking
- Resident messaging UI
- Demo admin authentication flow
- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile
- Local mock data support for quick demo runs

## Tech Stack

- React + Vite
- TypeScript
- CSS custom styling (no extra heavy framework required for quick deployment)
- Node.js + Express backend structure
- Prisma + PostgreSQL-ready schema
- Docker support for local environment setup

